# state: any   (no profile step; lane.mkdawhite1018, #1058)
# Mortal Kombat: Deadly Alliance (4D57000C): boot -> Arcade -> a fight, blind.
#
# Recorded from three pathfind runs of the title on the Nova
# (docs/lanes/pathfind/runs/sweep-4D57000C, rehold-4D57000C, deadly-alliance-1006
# steps.jsonl). All three saw the same nine screens in the same order:
#   logo (A) -> logo + copyright (A) -> storage status, no memory unit (START)
#   -> logo (A) -> PRESS START title (START) -> main menu, ARCADE lit (A)
#   -> character select, Shang Tsung under the cursor (A) -> stage card (START)
#   -> ROUND 1.
# In the 10-06 run the first logo was up 35 s after launch (the emulator
# started 14:09:48, pathfind's clock at 14:10:17, step 1 at t=5.8) and the
# round started about 84 s after launch. Each screen took a press 4-5 s apart
# in the replays.
#
# A START after the stage card opens the pause panel with RESUME lit (sweep
# step 10, rehold step 38), and A resumes. The play loop uses that to stay
# self-healing: every cycle presses START then A, which resumes a fight, leaves
# a title screen (START), picks ARCADE and the character (A), and accepts a
# CONTINUE? prompt (A = yes, sweep frame 041). The fight costs ~2 s of pause a
# cycle.
wait 30
shot boot30
press A 150                 # logo 1
wait 4.5
shot s1
press A 150                 # logo 2 + copyright
wait 4.5
shot s2
press START 150             # storage status: continue without saving
wait 4.5
shot s3
press A 150                 # logo 3
wait 4.5
shot s4
press START 150             # PRESS START title
wait 5
shot s5
press A 150                 # main menu: ARCADE
wait 6
shot s6
press A 150                 # character select
wait 9
shot s7
press START 150             # stage card
wait 12
shot s8
press A 150                 # resumes a pause the START may have opened
wait 3
shot round
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LX max
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    mash A 3 0.3
    wait 0.4
    mash X 2 0.3
    wait 0.6
    axis LX min
    wait 0.6
    axis LX mid
    mash B 2 0.3
    wait 0.6
    axis LX max
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    mash Y 2 0.3
    wait 3
    press START 150         # self-heal: title -> menu; in a fight, pause
    wait 1.5
    press A 150             # RESUME / ARCADE / pick / CONTINUE
    wait 1.5
}
